# The assistant tab's chat endpoint.
#
# /assistant/ is proxied by nginx to ragbot.service -- a local RAG assistant
# (uvicorn + ollama) running on 127.0.0.1:8001, which serves /chat, so the
# prefix is stripped on the way through. The service is deployed by hand and
# is not in this repository; scripts/deploy.sh routes to it but never installs
# or restarts it.
#
# That nginx location used to be hand-added on the box, and deploy.sh rewrites
# the whole server block every time -- so a deploy removed it, the tab fell
# through to the SPA catch-all, and every question died on JSON.parse against
# index.html. The location now lives in deploy.sh, which is the only file that
# gets to decide what nginx routes.
#
# A hosted alternative exists at /api/v1/assistant/chat (Claude, in the Go
# app, session-authenticated) for a deployment with no local model. Point this
# variable at it to switch; it needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY on the server.
#
# Empty or absent, the tab says "Not connected" rather than posting questions
# into the dark.
VITE_ASSISTANT_URL=/assistant/chat
